quiz 3 | Equivalent resistance of 4 Ω in series with (6 Ω ∥ 3 Ω)?
* 6 Ω
o 13 Ω
o 3 Ω
o 9 Ω
= 6 ∥ 3 = 2. 4 + 2 = 6.
